    "クリップの途中で速さを変えます(ゆっくり→速く など)。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Changes speed within the clip (slow → fast, etc.)."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cambia la velocidad dentro del clip (lento → rápido, etc.)."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Muda a velocidade dentro do clipe (lento → rápido etc.)."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "クリップの間で%@が大きく違います。別の日・別のカメラの素材が混ざっているときは、「カラーマッチ」でお手本のクリップに合わせると統一感が出ます。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Clips differ a lot in %@. When footage from different days or cameras is mixed, “Color Match” to a reference clip gives a consistent look."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Los clips difieren mucho en %@. Si mezclas material de distintos días o cámaras, “Igualar color” con un clip de referencia da un aspecto uniforme."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Os clipes diferem muito em %@. Ao misturar material de dias ou câmeras diferentes, “Igualar cor” com um clipe de referência dá um visual uniforme."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "クリップの間で音量が最大 %lld dB 違います。急に大きくなったり小さくなったりすると聞きづらいので、そろえましょう。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Volume differs by up to %lld dB between clips. Sudden jumps are hard to listen to, so level them."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "El volumen varía hasta %lld dB entre clips. Los saltos repentinos cansan al oído; nivélalos."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "O volume varia até %lld dB entre os clipes. Saltos repentinos cansam o ouvido; nivele-os."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "クリップの間の音量の差は %lld dB で、そろっています。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Clip volumes are within %lld dB of each other."
