    "元の素材の合計は %@ です。目標より短くするときは、見どころを選んで残します。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The source footage totals %@. When the target is shorter, highlights are picked and kept."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "El material original suma %@. Si el objetivo es más corto, se eligen y conservan los mejores momentos."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "O material original soma %@. Se o alvo for menor, os melhores momentos são escolhidos e mantidos."
          }
        }
      }
    },
