    "終わるまで、このアプリを\n開いたままにしてください。\nホームに戻ると約30秒で止まります。\n画面は自動でロックされません。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Keep this app open until it finishes.\\nIt stops about 30 s after you go to the Home Screen.\\nThe screen will not lock automatically."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mantén esta app abierta hasta que termine.\\nSe detiene unos 30 s después de ir a la pantalla de inicio.\\nLa pantalla no se bloqueará automáticamente."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mantenha este app aberto até terminar.\\nEle para cerca de 30 s depois de ir para a tela inicial.\\nA tela não será bloqueada automaticamente."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "終わるまで、このアプリを開いたままにしてください(ホームに戻ると約30秒で止まります)。画面は自動でロックされません。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Keep this app open until it finishes (it stops about 30 s after you go to the Home Screen). The screen will not lock automatically."
          }
